            "detailed_description": "<h1>JUNTA-TE AO NOSSO DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/7535c52d306ee22ce1fc2b35673876f0.avif?t=1794249724\" width=1170 height=245 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/ee1cfb206b57fc6024550dbf7035cd7e.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/ee1cfb206b57fc6024550dbf7035cd7e.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span><strong>Usurpator é um slasher de extração com combates corpo a corpo frenéticos</strong> em que lutas para libertar estas terras do mal. Arma-te e entra numa terra repleta de perigos. Domina combates brutais, enfrenta as hordas do mal e forma alianças, ou trava combate com outros jogadores. Cria armas poderosas, desbloqueia talentos únicos e abre o teu caminho até à glória.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.poster.avif?t=1794249724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.webm?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.mp4?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/89ab5d08ef3849c8d45e960b68bd798b.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/89ab5d08ef3849c8d45e960b68bd798b.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span>Atravessa o portal do teu acampamento e aventura-te em terras vastas e perigosas assoladas pelo mal. Conclui missões, reúne recursos e descobre saque valioso e receitas de criação. Enfrenta criaturas e jogadores rivais e depois abre caminho até um lugar seguro para levares as tuas recompensas para casa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/3d673265fff1ed3b25f1938c4b882cbb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/3d673265fff1ed3b25f1938c4b882cbb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span>Frenético e fácil de aprender, o combate de <i>Usurpator</i> recompensa a precisão e a perícia. Encadeia combos, bloqueia ataques e apara golpes ou esquiva-te para levares a melhor sobre os teus inimigos. Rompe defesas, atira inimigos de penhascos e domina a lâmina para vencer até os adversários mais ferozes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/08b41a241b520631d9fc92e403583ada.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/08b41a241b520631d9fc92e403583ada.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span>Torna-te mais forte ao derrotar inimigos e concluir missões exigentes. Define o teu estilo de jogo com talentos únicos e runas mágicas que podes criar para as tuas armas e equipamento. Melhora a tua configuração com joias mágicas poderosas e faz com que o teu herói se destaque com elementos cosméticos impressionantes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/6eb57f5137a835821dac6e12b1634aa9.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/6eb57f5137a835821dac6e12b1634aa9.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/45b790f6a59e8fe4d7be8cc929e866c8.poster.avif?t=1794249724\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/45b790f6a59e8fe4d7be8cc929e866c8.webm?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/45b790f6a59e8fe4d7be8cc929e866c8.mp4?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recolhe recursos do mundo à tua volta e transforma-os em runas poderosas para armas, feitiços potentes e poções de cura. Expande o teu arsenal, desde lanças de arremesso a bolas de fogo devastadoras, e prepara-te para os perigos que te esperam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/41a9c15bad10a5dc44bff8f387e00b4a.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/41a9c15bad10a5dc44bff8f387e00b4a.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span>Entra na Arena e luta pela glória. Compete a solo ou junta-te a amigos para subir na classificação, provar a tua perícia e conquistar em <i>Usurpator</i> o teu lugar entre os maiores cavaleiros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/6a4026de3084523729e0393c0c484c4a.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/6a4026de3084523729e0393c0c484c4a.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/ee1cfb206b57fc6024550dbf7035cd7e.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/ee1cfb206b57fc6024550dbf7035cd7e.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=99 /></span><strong>Usurpator é um slasher de extração com combates corpo a corpo frenéticos</strong> em que lutas para libertar estas terras do mal. Arma-te e entra numa terra repleta de perigos. Domina combates brutais, enfrenta as hordas do mal e forma alianças, ou trava combate com outros jogadores. Cria armas poderosas, desbloqueia talentos únicos e abre o teu caminho até à glória.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.poster.avif?t=1794249724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.webm?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/4ed079a10208f103092a9000a8dbb4b6.mp4?t=1794249724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.avif?t=1794249724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/718550/extras_big/bee5679180d47657d85e03543a712deb.webp?t=1794249724 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: